mathc init --agent opencode installs the per-user opencode
skill at ${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-${HOME}/.config}/opencode/skills/
math-coding/SKILL.md, copying the in-repo source. Other
agent values print a one-liner pointing at the right install
path (TODO in this slice).

The cram shell's cwd is a bwrap tmp dir. To keep the snapshot
portable across hosts, $XDG_CONFIG_HOME is redirected to a
per-test tmpdir (the per-user install writes there), and
the test cleans up after itself. The expected snapshot is
regenerated by `dune promote` whenever the bwrap scratch
path changes (per-run tmpdir hash differs).

--agent opencode: per-user skill installed.

  $ cd "$DUNE_SOURCEROOT"
  $ tmpdir=$(mktemp -d)
  $ mkdir -p "$tmpdir/xdg"
  $ export XDG_CONFIG_HOME="$tmpdir/xdg"
  $ export HOME="$tmpdir"
  $ mathc init "$tmpdir/repo" --agent opencode --no-install
  mathc init: created /tmp/nix-shell.iouuED/build_ca92e9_dune/tmp.CmdyR0JflV/repo/decisions, /tmp/nix-shell.iouuED/build_ca92e9_dune/tmp.CmdyR0JflV/repo/attestations
    decision.yaml: schema math-coding/3.2, scope paths editable
    pre-commit hook: skipped (--no-install)
    per-user opencode skill: installed at /tmp/nix-shell.iouuED/build_ca92e9_dune/tmp.CmdyR0JflV/xdg/opencode/skills/math-coding/SKILL.md
  $ per_user="$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/opencode/skills/math-coding/SKILL.md"
  $ test -f "$per_user" && echo "per-user skill present: ok"
  per-user skill present: ok
  $ rm -rf "$tmpdir"

--agent generic (default): no per-user install (the in-repo
.opencode/skills/math-coding/SKILL.md is the per-repo surface;
a generic agent does not need a per-user copy).

  $ cd "$DUNE_SOURCEROOT"
  $ tmpdir=$(mktemp -d)
  $ mathc init "$tmpdir" --agent generic --no-install
  mathc init: created /tmp/nix-shell.iouuED/build_ca92e9_dune/tmp.uPspRNzrYw/decisions, /tmp/nix-shell.iouuED/build_ca92e9_dune/tmp.uPspRNzrYw/attestations
    decision.yaml: schema math-coding/3.2, scope paths editable
    pre-commit hook: skipped (--no-install)
  $ test ! -f "${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-$HOME/.config}/opencode/skills/math-coding/SKILL.md.new" && \
  >   echo "no per-user install for generic agent"
  no per-user install for generic agent
  $ rm -rf "$tmpdir"

